# Input

```svelte
<svelte:head>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
        {
            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "etc..."
        }
    </script>
    {@html `<style>${getCssText()}</style>`}
</svelte:head>

<pre class="p-2">
    {`<div>
        <span>Hello</span>
        <span>World</span>
      </div>

      <style lang="postcss">
        span {
          @apply text-red-500;
        }
      </style>`}
</pre>

```


